WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,810
Speaking of which, you are all together

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,810
Why don't you ask her to have dinner with you?

3
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:07,810
She is too busy training

4
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:08,810
But she promised me

5
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:10,810
Accompany me to go hiking in Qingming Mountain on Saturday

6
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:12,810
Then we can have a good date

7
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:15,160
Xiaomu is also with Miko

8
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,160
Isn't it just to get close to me?

9
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,160
Why don't you take the opportunity to come and have dinner with me?

10
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,160
But he didn’t even plan to ask me out for a hike

11
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:24,290
Master Lu, her face is so angry with you

12
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,290
I want to go too

13
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:28,120
That's what I'm waiting for

14
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:30,120
Keke, you shouldn’t be in love anymore

15
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,120
You don’t want me as your best friend anymore.

16
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:34,120
OK you are my best friend

17
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,120
How could I rub you?

18
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:38,120
What will happen on Qingming Mountain on Saturday

19
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:40,120
It will definitely be fun

20
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:46,310
Let me set up a recovery group for everyone.

21
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:49,310
It’s a pity that everyone makes reservations
